/* ===== RELIGIOUS STUDIES · LAO (faith pack, July 2026) =====
   PRIMARILY FOR LAO PEOPLE (Laos) to learn about Jesus — Lao is the primary
   language everywhere (titles, story text, explanations), with English the
   quiet second line. Mirrors faith/ne.js: the same two stories, the same
   10+10 big-moment sections, the same shared scene art. Deliberately Christian
   (the secular-content rule does NOT apply in faith mode). Content register:
   rich storytelling for the un-churched reader — every person, place and
   church-word introduced in-story on first use (Adam & Eve, Eden, Noah,
   Abraham, sacrifice, the prophets, exile, disciples, Mary Magdalene).
   Paraphrase only — no Bible-translation text is copied; references name the
   passages retold.
   Vocabulary (checked against Lao Bible / Lao church usage): ພຣະເຈົ້າ (God),
   ພຣະອົງ (he, of God/Jesus — the divine honorific pronoun), ພຣະເຢຊູ (Jesus),
   ບາບ / ຄວາມບາບ (sin), ເຊື່ອ / ຄວາມເຊື່ອ (believe / faith), ຄວາມຮັກ (love),
   ຊ່ອຍໃຫ້ລອດ / ຄວາມລອດພົ້ນ (save / salvation), ພຣະຜູ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ລອດ (Rescuer),
   ຂ່າວປະເສີດ (gospel / good news), ໄມ້ກາງແຂນ (cross), ພຣະວິນຍານບໍລິສຸດ
   (Holy Spirit), ຄຳສັນຍາ (promise), ພັນທະສັນຍາ (covenant), ຄວາມສາມັກຄີ
   (fellowship), ຜູ້ປະກາດພຣະທຳ (prophet), ສາວົກ (disciple), ເຄື່ອງບູຊາ
   (sacrifice), ການເນລະເທດ (exile), ອານາຈັກ (kingdom), ສະຫວັນ (heaven),
   ພຣະວິຫານ (temple), ພິທີບັບຕິສະມາ (baptism), ອະທິຖານ (pray).
   Register: light honorific for God and Jesus as in Lao church usage — the
   ຊົງ- verb prefix (ຊົງສ້າງ created, ຊົງກ່າວ said), ສະເດັດມາ (came),
   ສະຖິດ / ຢູ່ (dwells), ສິ້ນພຣະຊົນ (died), ຄືນພຣະຊົນ (rose). Romanization
   follows the Lao course scheme in lang/lo.js (ASCII only; no tone marks;
   ph/th/kh aspirates — ph is a hard p, NOT f; doubled long vowels; words
   romanized as pronounced). Native strings must avoid the chars
   ' " < > \ (they ride inline onclick handlers — use dashes for speech).
   IMPORTANT: keep paras[i][0] AND note[0] byte-stable once audio exists —
   clips in audio-lof/ are hashed from these exact strings. Regenerate with
     osascript -l JavaScript extract_audio_strings.js lof
     python3 generate_audio.py --lang lof
   Scene art is shared with the Nepali pack (language-independent scene
   emblems — scenes and symbols only, no depictions of God or of Jesus'
   face). */
